; Orchestrate CLI client failure vocabulary.
;
; Situated is defined locally rather than imported as a generic from
; datomic because datomic does not yet carry blanket Corporal/Datomic
; impls for Situated<F>. The local struct has an identical datom shape.

Library.{ 0 28 0 }
[ protos:[ Extent ]
  datomic:[ Fault ]
  signal_orchestrate:Refusal ]
[ Situated.{ Option<Extent> Fault }
  ClientFailure.[ Unreadable.Situated Unreachable.{ Text Text } Refused.Refusal ] ]
[]
[]
